    "orderConfirmation": "Thank you for your order! It's on its way to Choco Makes, and you'll get a reply by email soon to confirm your items and arrange a time for pickup on campus. You can pay by e-Transfer, contactless at pickup, or cash (exact change is appreciated, as change can't be guaranteed). Nothing has been charged yet.",
